IGASHI TAKEO</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>ITOH TADAYOSHI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>UEYAMA TAKAHISA</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>HIGASHI, TAKEO</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>ITOH, TADAYOSHI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>UEYAMA, TAKAHISA</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>A packaging laminate (for use especially in fish or meat) which is composed of at least three layers consisting of an inner surface layer coming into contact with an object to be packed, an intermediate layer adjacent thereto, and an outer surface layer, wherein the inner surface layer contains an inorganic lubricant and an organic lubricant and the intermediate layer contains an organic lubricant, and which is thermally self-weldable.  It not only gives a vacuum package whose edge is excellent in transparency and gloss, but has self weldability.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>L'invention concerne un stratifié d'emballage (à utiliser notamment avec le poisson ou la viande) qui se compose d'au moins trois couches consistant en une couche intérieure venant en contact avec un objet à emballer, en une couche intermédiaire adjacente à ladite couche intérieure, et en une couche extérieure. La couche intérieure contient un lubrifiant inorganique et un lubrifiant organique, la couche intermédiaire un lubrifiant organique et est auto-scellable à chaud. Ainsi, on produit un emballage sous vide dont le bord présente une transparence et un brillant excellents tout en étant auto-scellable.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>